sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor I as Investor
  participant W as PWA + WASM signer
  participant S as settlement-rail M8
  participant V as pq-verifier M2
  participant VA as AssetVault M4
  participant IR as IdentityRegistry M3
  participant B as anchor-batcher M9
  participant A as PQAnchor
  I->>W: deposit PKR 5,000
  W->>S: onRamp account, PKR amount
  S->>S: double-entry ledger, PKR debit equals USDC credit
  S->>VA: test-net USDC credited
  W->>W: build PQEnvelope, sign Falcon-512, key in IndexedDB
  W->>V: envelope + 666-byte signature
  V->>V: allow-list, key, domain, clock, nonce, signature, payload
  V->>VA: execute deposit intent
  VA->>IR: investor verified? ONCHAINID claim
  VA->>VA: shares rounded down against depositor, offset 10^6
  VA-->>W: shares minted
  V->>B: leaf = keccak256 of envelope
  B->>A: root, leafCount, epoch within 60 s
  W->>B: request proof
  B-->>W: leaf, proof, epoch
  Note over W,A: Rust CLI verifies proof offline against on-chain root
